  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9IcuV5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/适用于我的世界-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安装于-仅客户端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mods-button/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Better Mods Button</strong> 将模组按钮重新添加到了暂停界面中（类似于 Minecraft 1.13 之前的 Forge 版本），以便方便地访问游戏内的模组配置（如有）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此外，提供了大量选项供你自定义模组按钮在屏幕上的显示位置与方式（深受 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 启发）。支持显示模组总数以及切换更新通知图标。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 截图：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/897/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/898/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>标题界面的默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>另一种模组按钮放置位置</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/899/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/900/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停菜单的默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>暂停界面的另一种放置位置</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/901/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停界面的又一种按钮放置位置</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组并直接在游戏内设置即可！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：有 Fabric 移植版吗？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>请使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 作者 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> 开发的版本。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Mods Button 的开发过程中得到了以下帮助与灵感：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> 为其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 模组启发了本模组的大多数配置选项</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
